OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FAlyson Stoner was a child star in
OL,7,     FHollywood, with regular roles in
OL,8,     Fsmash-hit Disney movies. But
OL,9,     Fgrowing up under the spotlight was
OL,10,     Ffar from picture perfect.
OL,11,G0350 Witness History
OL,12,     FIn 1988, the idea was born of
OL,13,     Fplanting 52 million trees in
OL,14,     FGuatemala to offset the
OL,15,     Fenvironmental effects of a new
OL,16,     Fcoal-fired power plant.
